  "description": "VOODOO MARASA MEN\n\nCreating the perfect hybrid bike means finding the ultimate balance between comfort, performance, practicality, and versatility, and the Marasa doesn’t disappoint. With a frame geometry, sizing and components designed to fit taller riders than the Marasa Women version, this Marasa Men shares many of the features of its sister.\n\nWith a reliable Shimano drivetrain, powerful hydraulic disc brakes and tough Maxxis Overdrive tires, you’ll be able to easily explore all over your local area and discover the joys of cycling. For those who need the bike as a day-to-day option, bottle, rack and mudguard mounts ensure the Marasa Men Hybrid bike is a practical option. With such a carefully considered design, the Marasa is an extremely versatile and capable hybrid bike.\n\nThe Marasa Men Hybrid bike takes inspiration from Voodoo’s range of mountain bikes to provide a bike that’s fast, comfortable, and perfectly optimized for urban riding.",
